      "trackName": "PokerTime Deluxe",
      "description": "Can't make it to Vegas this weekend?  It's still poker time with Poker Time Deluxe.  Get the action of video poker right on your iOS device with our fun, interactive video poker simulation.  No ads interrupt your game so it's nothing but non-stop fun on your iPad, iPhone, Apple TV or Apple Watch.\n\nWith Poker Time Deluxe additional game credits are always FREE.  Poker Time Deluxe provides endless hours of play for a single low price of just 99 cents! \n\nIf you have a streak of bad luck and you lose all your chips, don't worry additional banks of 100 chips are free.\n\nNow available for iPad, iPod, iPhone, Apple TV and Apple Watch.",
